title: Beginning
---
<<declare $goodend = 0>>
<<declare $badend = 0>>
<<playMusic frisscityCalm>>
<<camera Understory>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<bike Luna_Neutral on>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
Luna: Come on, you stupid SL0P app. Show me the big offers!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_annoyed>>
Luna: (Kaya is gonna kill me if I skip out on rent again. Just one big delivery gig should help me break even…)
<<playSFX notification>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_surprise>>
<<show_notification 0>>
Luna: (Huh? Someone actually rated me on the SL0P app?)
<<jump BR>>
===


title: BR
---
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_annoyed>>
Luna: You've got to be joking.
Luna: (I have an option to respond…)

-> Don't respond and close the app
   <<set $goodend += 1>>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
   Luna: Ugh, whatever.
   <i>I can't wait for this day to be over so I can get back to Root Town.</i>
   <<jump CyberdeckT>>
-> Give the reviewer a 1-star rating
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
   Luna: Heh, shove it.
   <i>I give Karen a 1-star rating right back, noting how her fruitarian and vegan preferences were never mentioned in the app.</i>
   <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_annoyed>>
   <i>I'm waiting for the day everyone in Frisscity finally decides to upload their brains to the cloud. If the AGENTS founder does it, I'm sure they’ll do it, too.</i>
   <<jump CyberdeckT>>
-> Doxx their address on an online forum for SL0P drivers
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck>>
    Luna: Good luck getting your stupid apples and cheese delivered.
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_annoyed>>
    <i>This is the thanks I get. Breaking my back for people who chase trends and get hooked up with the latest AGENTS technology.</i>
    <i>I just wish Frisscity would just disappear.</i>
    <<jump CyberdeckT>>
===


title: CyberdeckT
---
<<playSFX notification>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_cyberdeck_annoyed>>
<<show_notification 1>>
Luna: Now what?
//<<fadeIn 2>>
<<set_cyberdeck_state 1>>
<<jump Tutorial_Chat>>
===


title: Tutorial_Chat
---
<<wait 0.5>>
Nat: Hiiii, it's your fave roomie!! ^.^ How’s your night going?
Luna: like slop
Nat: Oh no! I hope you don't think this device I made you is slop too ToT
Luna: chill out Nat! i like it. idk how it's different from my old phone.
Nat: Hmm have you tried the other features I programmed into it?
Luna: no
Luna: can you walk me through it again?
Nat: Yes! I'd LOVE to ^.^
Nat: Welcome to your very own <b>cyberdeck</b>! It's like your phone, BUT BETTER hehe
Nat: You’re on the <b>Messages</b> screen! Sort through spam, news, and VERY important messages from me.
<<highlight_tab messages>>
Nat: <b>Settings</b> lets you tweak things like sound. You can also <b>quit the game</b> from Settings.
<<highlight_tab settings>>
Nat: <b>History</b> lets you snoop through old conversations. (It even tracks your inner thoughts.)
<<highlight_tab history>>
Luna: umm that's creepy?
Nat: Wait waittt I also made a cute little <b>mini-game</b> just for you! Click on the little monster icon to play it.
<<highlight_tab minigame>>
Nat: And when you’re done? Click <b>Exit</b>! You can always come back here by clicking the CYBERDECK 3000 logo.
<<highlight_tab exit>>
Luna: thanks. and yeah it made sense. can i go back to work now?
<<clear_highlights>>
Nat: Of course! Holler if you need anything, roomie <3
<<wait_for_cyberdeck_exit>>
<<enable_cyberdeck_exit>>
//<<loadScene JenScene>>
===